OL,3,GNEWSASpeedway star Lambert rides to
OL,4,Aworld title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speedway star from Norfolk has been
OL,7,Fcrowned the new world champion.
OL,9,FNorwich-born Robert Lambert, 28,
OL,10,Fclinched the title after winning the
OL,11,Ffinal Grand Prix of the season at his
OL,12,Fhome track in Torun, Poland, on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FThe former King's Lynn Stars rider told
OL,16,Fhis first club: "I'm super happy. I
OL,17,Fnever expected or planned to do what
OL,18,Fhappened in the second half of the
OL,19,Fseason."
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
