OL,3,GNEWSASpeedway star Lambert rides to
OL,4,Aworld title
OL,5,
OL,6,FLambert, whose international success
OL,7,Femulates that of Norfolk's last world
OL,8,Fchampionship winner Michael Lee in
OL,9,F1980, continued: "It kind of happened
OL,10,Fnaturally and when it happens like
OL,11,Fthat, it's meant to be."
